"{\n  \"AND\": {\n    \"left\": {\n      \"AND\": {\n        \"left\": {\n          \"AND\": {\n            \"left\": {\n              \"AND\": {\n                \"left\": {\n                  \"OR\": {\n                    \"left\": {\n                      \"raw_text\": \"Have had a prior endobronchial treatment for emphysema\"\n                    },\n                    \"right\": {\n                      \"raw_text\": \"or pleural or interstitial disease that precludes surgery\"\n                    }\n                  }\n                },\n                \"right\": {\n                  \"OR\": {\n                    \"left\": {\n                      \"raw_text\": \"Have had a prior lung transplant, LVRS, median sternotomy, bullectomy or lobectomy\"\n                    },\n                    \"right\": {\n                      \"raw_text\": \"or clinically significant bronchiectasis\"\n                    }\n                  }\n                }\n              }\n            },\n            \"right\": {\n              \"AND\": {\n                \"left\": {\n                  \"OR\": {\n                    \"left\": {\n                      \"raw_text\": \"Have a pulmonary nodule requiring surgery\"\n                    },\n                    \"right\": {\n                      \"raw_text\": \"or history of recurrent respiratory infections (> 3 hospitalization in the last year)\"\n                    }\n                  }\n                },\n                \"right\": {\n                  \"OR\": {\n                    \"left\": {\n                      \"raw_text\": \"Have clinically significant (> 4 Tablespoons per day) sputum production\"\n                    },\n                    \"right\": {\n                      \"raw_text\": \"or fever, elevated white cell count, or other evidence of active infection\"\n                    }\n                  }\n                }\n              }\n            }\n          }\n        },\n        \"right\": {\n          \"AND\": {\n            \"left\": {\n              \"OR\": {\n                \"left\": {\n                  \"raw_text\": \"Have dysrhythmia that might pose a risk during exercise or training\"\n                },\n                \"right\": {\n                  \"raw_text\": \"or congestive heart failure within 6 mo and LVEF < 45%\"\n                }\n              }\n            },\n            \"right\": {\n              \"OR\": {\n                \"left\": {\n                  \"raw_text\": \"Have evidence or history of Cor Pulmonale\"\n                },\n                \"right\": {\n                  \"raw_text\": \"or resting bradycardia (< 50 beats/min), frequent multifocal PVCs, complex ventricular arrhythmia, sustained SVT\"\n                }\n              }\n            }\n          }\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    \"right\": {\n      \"AND\": {\n        \"left\": {\n          \"OR\": {\n            \"left\": {\n              \"raw_text\": \"Have history of exercise-related syncope\"\n            },\n            \"right\": {\n              \"raw_text\": \"or MI within 6 mo and LVEF < 45%\"\n            }\n          }\n        },\n        \"right\": {\n          \"OR\": {\n            \"left\": {\n              \"raw_text\": \"Have evidence of systemic disease or neoplasia expected to compromise survival during 5-yr period\"\n            },\n            \"right\": {\n              \"raw_text\": \"or any disease or condition that interferes with completion of initial or follow-up assessments\"\n            }\n          }\n        }\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}"